Package: tierd
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: node daemon for Tier, a decentralized messaging/payments network
 Tier is a decentralized network for encrypted messaging and payments. This
 package provides the node daemon (tierd) and the local admin CLI (tierctl).
 .
 The daemon speaks QUIC (ngtcp2 over a vendored OpenSSL 3.5, statically linked)
 with an Ed25519 certificate-bound identity, and is managed by systemd. The
 vendored transport and crypto plus the C++ runtime are linked statically, so
 the only shared dependency is glibc.
